---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import LegalPage from "../components/LegalPage.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | khonsu.eu" canonicalPath="/privacy-policy">
  <LegalPage eyebrow="Website">
    <h1>Privacy Policy for khonsu.eu</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> May 6, 2026</p>

    <p>
      We process limited personal data to operate and secure this Website, and
      to respond if you contact us.
    </p>

    <h2>Controller and contact</h2>
    <p><strong>Controller:</strong> Khonsu Development (Berlin, Germany).</p>
    <p>
      <strong>Email:</strong>{" "}
      <a href="mailto:khonsu.development@gmail.com">
        khonsu.development@gmail.com
      </a>
    </p>

    <h2>What we process</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Server logs</strong>: IP address, timestamps, requested URLs,
        user agent, errors.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Messages</strong>: if you email us, we process the content and
        your contact details.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Why we process it</h2>
    <p>
      To deliver the Website, prevent abuse, troubleshoot issues, and respond to
      inquiries. Where the GDPR applies, our legal basis is legitimate interests
      (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR), and where applicable, Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      We do not currently use analytics or marketing cookies. If we add
      analytics later (for example, Google Analytics), we will update this
      policy and implement consent where required.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Where the GDPR applies, you may have rights such as access, rectification,
      deletion, objection, and complaint to a supervisory authority. To exercise
      rights, contact us by email.
    </p>
  </LegalPage>
</BaseLayout>
